{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"grand_academy","model_identifier":"grand_academy","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# grand_academy\n\nGrand Academy: a grand marble hall with a ribbed copper-green dome on a drum and a columned portico across the front.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 12 columns (224 x 192 units, 6.30 x 5.40 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -100..100, y 0..228, z -100..80 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 95, construction_0 30, construction_33 79, construction_66 96, ruined 90 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hall: 200 x 124 x 168 centred at x 0, z -4\n- dome: 84 x 104 x 84 above it at x 0, z 12\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `grand_academy_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `grand_academy_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_grand_academy` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -108)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"podium","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-100.0,0.0,-88.0],"to":[100.0,10.0,80.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[219.0,600.0,419.0,610.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,616.0,168.0,626.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[219.0,600.0,419.0,610.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,616.0,168.0,626.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,226.0,168.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,226.0,168.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a5957154-f914-5c4c-b496-28e108f8208a"},{"name":"steps0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-60.0,0.0,-100.0],"to":[60.0,4.0,-88.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,686.0,120.0,690.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[427.0,686.0,439.0,690.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,686.0,120.0,690.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[427.0,686.0,439.0,690.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[65.0,600.0,185.0,612.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[65.0,600.0,185.0,612.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"06238e26-2e9d-5f35-951f-9f697c82ff44"},{"name":"steps1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-60.0,0.0,-96.0],"to":[60.0,7.0,-88.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[294.0,636.0,414.0,643.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[414.0,636.0,422.0,643.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[294.0,636.0,414.0,643.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[414.0,636.0,422.0,643.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[352.0,626.0,472.0,634.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[352.0,626.0,472.0,634.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"de794730-12aa-5a73-8648-99c08e525db7"},{"name":"steps2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emis